# 前端 Vue SFC 编码规范（MR）

> 术语以 [Glossary](../../_meta/Glossary.mdc) 为准，骨架以 [RuleSkeleton](../../_meta/RuleSkeleton.mdc) 为准。

---

## 1. 职责

SFC 是视图层的**唯一载体**，只做三件事：

1. **渲染 UI**：通过 `<template>` + 布局组件（`StdListContainer` + `StdListAreaQuery` + `StdListAreaAction` + `StdListAreaTable`）构建页面结构
2. **绑定事件**：DOM 事件 → 解构后的 Service 方法
3. **解构 Service**：从 Service 文件解构响应式状态与方法，不自行创建业务状态

**不做什么**：
- 不含业务逻辑（数据转换、状态判断、流程控制）→ 属于 Service 层
- 不直接调用 `Http.postEntity` → 属于 Api 层
- 不声明 `interface | enum | type` → 属于 Api 层
- 不自行管理表单校验规则 → 属于 Service 层

---

## 2. 文件骨架

```
<template>          — StdListContainer 拼装 + StdListArea* 子组件 + Element Plus 组件 + 事件绑定
<script setup lang="ts">  — import → 解构 Service → 本地 UI 状态 → markRaw 图标
<style scoped>      — 仅覆盖本组件的样式，不写全局样式
```

文件位置：`views/<域>/<Entity><角色>.vue`，PascalCase。

---

## 3. 硬性规则（Must）

1. Manager 页面根元素必须使用 `StdListContainer`，内部按序拼装 `StdListAreaQuery`、`StdListAreaAction`（有按钮时才保留）、`StdListAreaTable`、`el-dialog`
2. `StdListAreaTable` 必须绑定 `v-model:list-form="listForm"`、`:list-total="listTotal"`、`:load-list="loadList"` 三个属性，不使用 `#pagination` 插槽
3. Modal 弹窗根元素使用 `el-dialog`，通过 `v-if="modalVisible"` 控制挂载
4. `el-dialog` 必须设置 `:close-on-click-modal="false"`，`@close` 统一为 `resetModal(); loadList();`
5. `el-form` 必须设置 `:validate-on-rule-change="false"`
6. `el-table` 必须设置 `height="100%"`
7. Element Plus 图标必须 `markRaw()` 包裹后再使用
8. `<script setup lang="ts">` 内只能有：`import` → `markRaw` 图标 → 本地 UI 状态 → 解构 Service
9. 解构 Service 时 `useXxxModal` 的入参固定为 `(modalFormRef, loadList)`
10. 禁止在 SFC 内声明 `interface | enum | type | const Options`
11. 禁止在 SFC 内写业务判断（`if (mode === 'add')` 做不同逻辑）、数据转换
12. 禁止在 SFC 内直接调用 `Http.postEntity` 或 `XxxApi.xxxMethod()`
13. 模态框内 `el-input` 必须设置 `maxlength` + `show-word-limit`（需与后端 `@Size` / `@Length` 对齐，形成三位一体校验）
14. 禁止相对路径导入，统一 `@/` 前缀
15. 禁用 `else` / `switch`

---

## 4. 模板（Templates）

### Manager 页面 SFC

```vue
<template>
  <StdListContainer>
    <StdListAreaQuery>
      <el-form :model="listForm" :inline="true">
        <el-row :gutter="16">
          <el-col :span="6">
            <el-form-item label="标题" prop="title">
              <el-input v-model="listForm.title" placeholder="请输入标题" clearable />
            </el-form-item>
          </el-col>
          <!-- 其他查询字段 -->
        </el-row>
      </el-form>
    </StdListAreaQuery>

    <StdListAreaAction>
      <el-button type="primary" @click="openModal('add')">创建Xxx</el-button>
    </StdListAreaAction>

    <StdListAreaTable v-model:list-form="listForm" :list-total="listTotal" :load-list="loadList">
      <el-table :data="listData" v-loading="listLoading" border stripe height="100%">
        <el-table-column type="index" label="序号" width="60" />
        <el-table-column prop="title" label="标题" show-overflow-tooltip />
        <!-- 其他列 -->
        <el-table-column label="操作" width="200" fixed="right">
          <template #default="{ row }">
            <el-button link type="primary" :icon="ViewIcon" @click="openModal('view', row)">查看</el-button>
            <el-button link type="primary" :icon="EditIcon" @click="openModal('edit', row)">编辑</el-button>
            <el-button link type="danger" :icon="DeleteIcon" @click="removeList(row)">删除</el-button>
          </template>
        </el-table-column>
      </el-table>
    </StdListAreaTable>

    <el-dialog
      v-if="modalVisible"
      v-model="modalVisible"
      :title="modalMode === 'add' ? '创建Xxx' : '编辑Xxx'"
      :close-on-click-modal="false"
      width="700px"
      @close="resetModal(); loadList();"
    >
      <el-form
        ref="modalFormRef"
        :model="modalForm"
        :rules="modalRules"
        :validate-on-rule-change="false"
        label-width="100px"
      >
        <el-form-item label="标题" prop="title">
          <el-input v-model="modalForm.title" placeholder="请输入标题" clearable maxlength="100" show-word-limit />
        </el-form-item>
        <!-- 其他表单项 -->
      </el-form>
      <template #footer>
        <el-button @click="resetModal(); loadList();">取消</el-button>
        <el-button type="primary" @click="submitModal" :loading="modalLoading">确定</el-button>
      </template>
    </el-dialog>
  </StdListContainer>
</template>

<script setup lang="ts">
import { ref, markRaw, reactive } from "vue";
import { Edit, Delete, View } from "@element-plus/icons-vue";
import type { FormInstance } from "element-plus";
import StdListContainer from "@/soa/std-series/StdListContainer.vue";
import StdListAreaQuery from "@/soa/std-series/StdListAreaQuery.vue";
import StdListAreaAction from "@/soa/std-series/StdListAreaAction.vue";
import StdListAreaTable from "@/soa/std-series/StdListAreaTable.vue";
import XxxService from "@/views/<域>/service/XxxService.ts";

const ViewIcon = markRaw(View);
const EditIcon = markRaw(Edit);
const DeleteIcon = markRaw(Delete);

const uiState = reactive({ isAdvancedSearch: false });

const {
  listForm,
  listData,
  listTotal,
  listLoading,
  loadList,
  resetList,
  removeList,
} = XxxService.useXxxList();

const modalFormRef = ref<FormInstance>();

const {
  modalVisible,
  modalLoading,
  modalMode,
  modalForm,
  modalRules,
  openModal,
  resetModal,
  submitModal,
} = XxxService.useXxxModal(modalFormRef, loadList);
</script>

<style scoped></style>
```

### Modal 组件 SFC

```vue
<template>
  <el-dialog
    v-model="visible"
    title="选择用户"
    :close-on-click-modal="false"
    width="800px"
    @close="onClose"
  >
    <el-form :model="queryForm" :inline="true">
      <el-form-item label="用户名" prop="username">
        <el-input v-model="queryForm.username" placeholder="请输入" clearable />
      </el-form-item>
      <el-form-item>
        <el-button type="primary" @click="loadList">查询</el-button>
        <el-button @click="resetQuery">重置</el-button>
      </el-form-item>
    </el-form>

    <el-table
      :data="listData"
      v-loading="listLoading"
      border
      highlight-current-row
      @row-click="onRowClick"
    >
      <el-table-column prop="username" label="用户名" />
      <!-- 其他列 -->
    </el-table>

    <el-pagination
      v-model:current-page="queryForm.pageNum"
      v-model:page-size="queryForm.pageSize"
      :total="listTotal"
      layout="prev, pager, next"
      @current-change="loadList"
    />

    <template #footer>
      <el-button @click="visible = false">关闭</el-button>
    </template>
  </el-dialog>
</template>

<script setup lang="ts">
import { reactive, ref, watch } from "vue";
import type { GetUserListDto, GetUserListVo } from "@/views/<域>/api/UserApi.ts";
import UserApi from "@/views/<域>/api/UserApi.ts";
import { Result } from "@/commons/model/Result.ts";
import { ElMessage } from "element-plus";

interface Props {
  modelValue: boolean;
}
interface Emits {
  (e: "update:modelValue", value: boolean): void;
  (e: "onSelected", value: GetUserListVo): void;
}

const props = defineProps<Props>();
const emit = defineEmits<Emits>();

const visible = ref(false);
const listData = ref<GetUserListVo[]>([]);
const listTotal = ref(0);
const listLoading = ref(false);
const queryForm = reactive<GetUserListDto>({ pageNum: 1, pageSize: 10 });

watch(() => props.modelValue, (val) => { visible.value = val; if (val) loadList(); });
watch(visible, (val) => { emit("update:modelValue", val); });

const loadList = async (): Promise<void> => {
  listLoading.value = true;
  const result = await UserApi.getUserList(queryForm);
  listLoading.value = false;
  if (Result.isSuccess(result)) {
    listData.value = result.data.records;
    listTotal.value = result.data.total;
    return;
  }
  ElMessage.error(result.message);
};

const resetQuery = (): void => {
  queryForm.pageNum = 1;
  queryForm.username = "";
  loadList();
};

const onRowClick = (row: GetUserListVo): void => {
  emit("onSelected", row);
  visible.value = false;
};

const onClose = (): void => {
  resetQuery();
};
</script>

<style scoped>
:deep(.selectable-row) { cursor: pointer; }
</style>
```

