## 5. 反模式（Anti-patterns）

```vue
<!-- ❌ 根元素不用 StdListContainer，自己写 div 排版 -->
<div class="my-page"><div class="query-area">...</div></div>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ StdListLayout + #pagination 旧写法，应改为 StdListContainer 拼装 + StdListAreaTable 内置分页 -->
<StdListLayout>
  <template #query>...</template>
  <template #table>...</template>
  <template #pagination><el-pagination ... /></template>
</StdListLayout>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ StdListAreaTable 未绑定 list-form / list-total / load-list 三属性 -->
<StdListAreaTable>
  <el-table ... />
</StdListAreaTable>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ el-dialog 不用 v-if，导致关闭后残留校验 -->
<el-dialog v-model="modalVisible">...</el-dialog>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ el-table 未设置 height="100%" -->
<el-table :data="listData" v-loading="listLoading" border stripe>...</el-table>
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ 输入框未设置 maxlength + show-word-limit，缺少三位一体校验 -->
<el-input v-model="modalForm.title" placeholder="请输入标题" clearable />
```

```vue
<!-- ❌ 图标未 markRaw -->
<el-button :icon="Edit" />
```

```ts
// ❌ SFC 内声明类型
interface LocalFormType { title: string; }
```

```ts
// ❌ SFC 内直接调 Api
const data = await NoticeApi.getNoticeList({ pageNum: 1, pageSize: 10 });
```

```ts
// ❌ SFC 内写业务判断
if (mode === 'add') { doSomethingDifferent(); }
```

