## 6. 速查（Cheat Sheet）

| 场景 | 组件/写法 | 必须 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Manager 页面布局 | `<StdListContainer>` + `StdListAreaQuery` + `StdListAreaAction` + `StdListAreaTable` + `el-dialog` | 是 |
| 表格区内置分页 | `<StdListAreaTable v-model:list-form="listForm" :list-total="listTotal" :load-list="loadList">` | 是 |
| Modal 弹窗 | `<el-dialog>` + `v-if="modalVisible"` | 是 |
| Modal 关闭 | `@close="resetModal(); loadList();"` | 是 |
| 防止点击遮罩关闭 | `:close-on-click-modal="false"` | 是 |
| 表单校验规则触发 | `:validate-on-rule-change="false"` | 是 |
| 表格高度 | `el-table` `height="100%"` | 是 |
| 图标 | `const XxxIcon = markRaw(Xxx)` | 是 |
| Service 解构 | `const { ... } = XxxService.useXxxList()` | 是 |
| Modal Service 入参 | `useXxxModal(modalFormRef, loadList)` | 是 |
| 表单引用 | `const modalFormRef = ref<FormInstance>()` | 是 |
| 输入框三位一体 | `maxlength` + `show-word-limit` + 后端 `@Size`/`@Length` | 是 |
| 导入 | `import type { ... }` + `@/` 前缀 | 是 |

| el-table 操作列 | 图标 | class |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 查看 | `<el-button link type="primary" :icon="ViewIcon">` | — |
| 编辑 | `<el-button link type="primary" :icon="EditIcon">` | — |
| 删除 | `<el-button link type="danger" :icon="DeleteIcon">` | — |

| el-table 属性 | 值 |
| --- | --- |
| `border` | true |
| `stripe` | true |
| `height` | `"100%"` |
| `v-loading` | `listLoading` |

| StdListAreaTable 属性 | 值 |
| --- | --- |
| `v-model:list-form` | `listForm` |
| `:list-total` | `listTotal` |
| `:load-list` | `loadList` |
